                        "entry_id": "fec38f56-fc38-3a5f-860f-4e2eeef751e8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Atropos, Clotho, and Lachesis; supernatural beings who controlled the destiny of men and of the gods."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Greek"
